F ClassifyIncircle                | Shared/IncircleClassifier.slang.h     | 135-237 | Classifies Delta against the circle through Alpha, Beta and Gamma. classify the winding first has written a predicate whose answer inverts on half its inputs, and the inversion presents as an unwrap that flips one chart in ten rather than as a wrong answer everywhere. lifted distance and both surviving determinants vanish identically rather than approximately.
